Usage: agent-deck remote sessions [name] [options]

Options:
  --json
        Output as JSON: a bare array of sessions
  --with-errors
        With --json, wrap output as {"sessions":[...],"errors":[...]} and
        exit 1 if any remote failed
        JSON includes transcript_path and harness-native session IDs when known;
        transcript_path belongs to the remote host.
  --json-envelope
        Alias for --json --with-errors
